## How to plot / movies on existing frames & small_data (no plotfiles needed)

```bash
# Ham/Mom + Psi4 GW plots → RUN/plots/
./grteclyn-wrapper/scripts/plot/plot_diagnostic.sh "$RUN" 8 12 24

# Movies from existing PNG frames
./grteclyn-wrapper/scripts/plot/make_movies.sh "$RUN" \
  --only Weyl4_Re_z Weyl4_Im_z Weyl4_Mag_z chi_z phi_z

# Replot Psi4 when psi4_mode_l2m0.dat is complete to t=30
./grteclyn-wrapper/scripts/plot/plot_extracted_psi4.sh "$RUN" --combined --strain
```

